<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH UTILITY STREDOCESKA ENERGETICKA 9MO GROSS FALLS.</title>
<headline>CZECH UTILITY STREDOCESKA ENERGETICKA 9MO GROSS FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine</p>
<p>months ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		   11.432    vs	 213.386</p>
<p> Operating profit	     72.860    vs	 369.714</p>
<p> Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		6,078.650    vs     5,823.565</p>
<p> Depriciation		  312.053    vs	 221.061</p>
<p> Total assets		8,344.688    vs     6,643.826</p>
<p> Basic capital	     3,209.386    vs     2,490.505</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Stredoceska Energeticka a.s., a central Czech electricity distributor. The results</p>
<p>were provided by the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE). Stredoceska</p>
<p>shares are traded on the main market of the PSE.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
